🏁 Conclusion

While PID controllers are simple and easy to implement, they are not suitable for complex, multi-variable systems like modern fuel injection control. LQR provides an optimal, efficient, and robust solution by considering the full system dynamics and minimizing a performance cost function.

Thus, LQR is a more advanced and reliable control strategy for high-performance engineering applications.